1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:03,766
You should be concerned about the NextEra takeover of Virginia's Dominion Energy,

2
00:00:03,766 --> 00:00:08,400
and here's part two of us explaining exactly why: your bills. Last time, we explained

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,600
how much influence they have over our politics,

4
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:14,766
and this has led to NextEra customers paying some of the highest rates in the country for electricity.

5
00:00:14,766 --> 00:00:19,666
This is in part because Florida subsidiary customers are already paying one of the highest profit shares in the country,

6
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:23,633
with NextEra's profit making up 27% of their monthly electric bill,

7
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:26,900
versus the still-massive 17% that Virginian customers pay.

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:31,166
Furthermore, NextEra made Florida second in the nation for disconnections.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:38,733
This means that under NextEra, Virginians who are already struggling to pay their electric bill, which keeps rising month after month, will increasingly face being disconnected,

10
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,566
something that literally costs lives.

11
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:45,000
If you're worried about this deal, your lawmakers need to hear from you. Contact them today

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,300
and share your concerns. Ask them what they're doing to protect their constituents,

13
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,800
and urge them to come out publicly in opposition to the acquisition

14
00:00:51,866 --> 00:00:53,533
and in support of Virginia families.
